                    Files, 1950–1952, classified general records, Box 25. Secret; Security
                    Information; Priority. Drafted by Stutesman; cleared in NEA by
                        Jernegan, in S/P by Nitze; and approved
                    by Matthews. Repeated to London.</p>
            </note>
